# Domain libraries. The engine creates this directory and lays out the
# structure of a library inside it, but each library is its own repository
# and is never tracked here. Content and behaviour are separate by
# construction — see documents/decisions/0007-engine-content-separation.md
kb/

# Watcher snapshots are copies of third-party pages (ADR-0012: saved by hand, compared
# offline). This repository is public, so they stay local; only the allowlist is tracked.
watcher/snapshots/
